<title>Southern Thailand: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/thailand/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-thailand-2026-11-02T18:37:28.964Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 18:37:28 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Thai forces have increased their presence near the Myanmar border in Mae Sot as Myanmar bombs damaged a health centre in a border village and artillery strikes hit villages in Tak and Mae Sot, prompting warning shots and a temporary closure of unofficial border trade. Thai police arrested two Singaporeans for advertising Thai women’s sex services via messaging apps and seized meth pills hidden in furniture, while Cambodian nationals were detained for illegal crossing. The Myanmar military warned Thai traders against supplying the KNU, which in turn warned Thailand against supporting rival forces. Japan is providing aid to 3,300 women and girls displaced by border clashes, and Malaysia approved a new train line extension to the Thai border. The conflict caused 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxPT0hFWHdXT3NFQzVVVTVhNzl5dkUtVnVjZUlGd202TG1ERkluOW1MWk12TU8wUU40MW1kV0FYc2NqQVBJM0lvWk05Y1FFQUM0YWMzN0tTbkRvMlBwbXBpeTA3dVhvWEl3X1B6QVRjSXlCcjRGYmpZMnhpa0ZzOW1SQ0tSRXRKUTJZZWM2alBrbmpnWDdETzd0ZHBER3poSUdCcmVhY3lTWWZickVjVEtRd0ZIRFFBRDh4Wnhr?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nikkei Asia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxPOEF1WEhoQ3BsTTZRQUpodXc2NnJBNTRqLWpWcnpPcXI3c3YtZE05NkFGRjVwMllLOXRMZGk2dnJ4VnJMS244WkJRU282dXZZenlaNFVFX000X0lUbS1Ub1ZWZDVFaWgyV1ZVeE5hRnZmVHZOYmhrWGZ5UVVEYW1NSkFBYVI4Qk9xY2xWZXRFd3hieUJLLTZTNA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khmer Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxQZTFCUlpVbkpjWWJjQmxSQV9lNU5xUmc4NWpsOEc0clBQSUhDREo4UXhqRWJiMUlhZmlwQTdWaFo1U3hXNVBWSFpCTjhYOG1UaEprcVFnY3Y0TDVScVZWbWdDd1VlZk91bE4xYk5GUHZCZ082TWpUZ3ZoQ2t4UGJzU29NTmF1OGtIQklZeU9oZ29PYUVrTjd2anR3ajdVMVJP?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khmer Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/article